 Quantum Mechanics, String Theory, and more - to reveal the extraordinary truth of our Universe.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.6}],"value":8.6,"age":"pg-13"},"current_season_id":7908,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}